card.statement:
The generator $c_{mk}$ of $\Gamma_q$ acts on $T(L)$ as multiplication by

\begin{equation}
\gamma_{mk}(\lambda)=(k)_{q^{-2}}!(m-k)_{q^{-2}}!q^{k(k+1)+\frac{m(m-3)}{2}}\sum_{\tau}
q^{\sum_{i=1}^{k}l_{m\tau(i)}-\sum_{i=k+1}^{m}l_{m\tau(i)}}
\end{equation}

where $\tau\in S_m$ is such that $\tau(1)<\cdots<\tau(k), \tau(k+1)<\cdots<\tau(m)$.
